ta segment 0, Ada/Fortran `.rodata`) -- D19: NOT byte-visible (unpacked payload of the appended PK19\n  overlay); D20: RAW again, at +48 inside the appended RS20 overlay (a plain `HCFG` scan finds it). Scan raw bytes for `HCFG` AND its base64 form `SENGR...` (crc-gate every hit); when both miss, look\n  for an overlay past the ELF image and read the question text -- it spells the unpacker.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"  `.data`, WASM data segment 0, Ada/Fortran `.rodata`, D21 OCaml plugin `.data`) -- D19: NOT byte-visible (packed PK19 overlay);\n  D20: RAW at +48 inside the RS20 overlay. Scan raw bytes for `HCFG` AND base64 `SENGR...` (crc-gate every hit); when both miss,\n  look for an overlay past the ELF image and read the question text -- it spells the unpacker.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"  D18 216, D19 228, D20 240, **D21 252** (12 new: 2 sha256 + 2 machine + 4 config + 4 plugin_config), no backfill D18-D21. Mastery = `setN.` prefixed copies (2 sets D2-D7, 5 D8-D9, 3 D10-D14,\n  5 D15-D17\"\"\",\"\"\"  D18 216, D19 228, D20 240, **D21 252**, no backfill D18-D21. Mastery = `setN.` prefixed copies (2 sets D2-D7, 5 D8-D9, 3 D10-D14,\n  5 D15-D17\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"| Group of a LOADER + its shared-object PLUGIN (D21), ids `dNN_analysis_<role>_<field>` + unqualified ids whose question names one member | Route qualified ids by file-name tag, unqualified ones by the member the QUESTION names; the loader may carry no HCFG |\n\"\"\",\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"| Two members differing by a name tag, ids `dNN_analysis_<tag>_<field>` | Route each id to the member whose file name carries `<tag>`; same HCFG in both |\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| Two members differing by a name tag (D15/D16 builds, D21 loader+plugin), ids `dNN_analysis_<tag>_<field>` | Route each id to the member whose file name carries `<tag>`; UNqualified ids -> the member the QUESTION names; a role member (loader) may carry no HCFG |\"\"\")\na=s.index('**D21 \"Shared Custody\"**'); b=s.index(\"## GM answer conventions learned\")\ns=s[:a]+\"\"\"**D21 \"Sh